        <h3>You have a dedicated IT team that self-manages everything</h3>
        <p>If you have IT staff who want full administrative control over your phone system configuration &mdash; custom SIP settings, API integrations, complex IVR trees &mdash; RingCentral or 8x8 give you more self-management capability. TurnCom360 is managed for you, which means less direct control for power users.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="switch-card">
        <h3>You only need 1&ndash;2 phones at bottom-tier pricing</h3>
        <p>For a truly minimal setup (one phone, one person, very low call volume), Ooma&rsquo;s residential or small office tier may undercut our pricing. We&rsquo;re built for businesses, not home offices. If you&rsquo;re under 3 phones, worth comparing carefully on price.</p>
